&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datadog AI Research — Scholars Program with Carnegie Mellon University&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog AI Research (DAIR) is partnering with Carnegie Mellon University to support a small number of PhD students working on open research problems grounded by ongoing efforts at Datadog/DAIR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will frame a problem, run your own experiments, and write up what you find, with compute and data at a scale most academic labs cannot provide.&amp;nbsp; You will collaborate with colleagues working on the same questions.&lt;/p&gt;
